      "side": 1,
      "message": "objtool complains about lretq for some reason:\n```\nvmlinux.o: warning: objtool: __pkvm_reprivilege_vcpu__pkvm+0x14e: unsupported instruction in callable function\n```",
      "revId": "e0c8ccef4f7c7a660983f3da88279d724a5187d5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ea0ebbaf_2f042a72",
        "filename": "arch/x86/kvm/vmx/pkvm/hyp/init_finalise.c",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 488,
      "author": {
        "id": 3702829
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-23T10:53:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had seen this and investigated, but sorry that I missed putting a comment. objtool complains on lretq because it didn\u0027t expect a far return from a callable function. objecttool expects this only in kernel entry/exit functions(syscall, intr nmi etc) and expects this only in assembly code (SYM_CODE_START/SYM_CODE_END). I had tried moving the last part of code to a asm file, but didn\u0027t help. We should probably upstream a change to objtool to ignore this usecase as well once we have a upstreamable version of this.\n\nI have put a small comment here now.",
      "parentUuid": "634c00ea_5afad339",
      "revId": "e0c8ccef4f7c7a660983f3da88279d724a5187d5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0fa45837_3249efb8",
        "filename": "arch/x86/kvm/vmx/pkvm/hyp/init_finalise.c",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 488,
      "author": {
        "id": 2022314
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-23T23:10:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok it\u0027s harmless but it means we\u0027re gonna see this warning every time we build kernel? So if we intend to merge this, should we implement such a change to objtool (to mute this warning) right away?",
      "parentUuid": "ea0ebbaf_2f042a72",
      "revId": "e0c8ccef4f7c7a660983f3da88279d724a5187d5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
