      "message": "Just some though in my mind. Can we use iret here rather than lretq? iret can also performs a far jump. If this is ok, then the objtool warning will be \"return with modified stack frame\". To handle this warning, probably the unwind hints in the \"asm/unwind_hints.h\" may be helpful with moving the code to asm file(SYM_CODE_START/SYM_CODE_END)?",
