      "writtenOn": "2025-06-23T10:53:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ahh, I missed this. I had tested on PKVM_INTEL_DEBUG and didn\u0027t get to testing without that. The issues is, we use same selectors(CS,DS, ES, ...) and TR with PKVM_INTEL_DEBUG but they are all different without PKVM_INTEL_DEBUG. Since we reprivilege before setting CR3, I thought restoring CR3 also was not needed. Now I am restoring all selectors, reloading TR explicitly and reprivilege works without PKVM_INTEL_DEBUG now. I am explicitly restoring CR3 as well (we would need it when we want to reprivilege if iommu init fails). So now it works as expected.",
      "parentUuid": "5f541441_1394a838",
      "revId": "e0c8ccef4f7c7a660983f3da88279d724a5187d5",
